      {
        "text": "First gen Gu Yue’s body under the Gu is a shrivelled corpse with a scarlet face and fangs, red hair, deep eyes holding a dying fire, no skin, and thin strips of red muscle clinging to white bone. He speaks from the abdomen with no mouth movement, using the archaic pronouns of a thousand years earlier. Lifespan Gu is difficult to find. The first head buried himself there.",
