  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "First gen Gu Yue’s aperture is long dead and can no longer recover primeval essence on its own. Unless he uses primeval stones, the primeval essence left in the aperture is a hard limit.",
        "chapters": [
          188
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "aperture-limit",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the fight with Lord Sky Crane he grows a pair of large jet-black bat wings from his back and meets that opponent in the air. Zombie Gu are a classic series widely spread in the world: rank two Roaming Zombie Gu, rank three Fur Zombie Gu, rank four Jumping Zombie Gu, and rank five Flying Zombie Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          192
