          "char_tie_xue_leng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan recalls having already seen blood wight Gu on Qing Mao Mountain. There are five great flying zombie Gu in the world: asura zombie, heavenly demon zombie, blood wight, nightmare zombie, and plague zombie. Asura zombie Gu is a formidable Gu equally famous as blood wight Gu. Asura zombie Gu belongs to the classic zombie series of transformation path. That series runs from rank two roaming zombie Gu up through rank five flying zombie Gu.",
        "chapters": [
